{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46919","headline":"送司空学士赴京 · 齐己","name":"送司空学士赴京","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"弘文初命下江边，难恋沙鸥与钓船。\n蓝绶乍称新学士，白衫初脱旧神仙。\n龙山送别风生路，鸡树从容雪照筵。\n重谒往年金牓主，便将才术佐陶甄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46919.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46919","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}